<<<

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
**Sensitivity analysis:** Holding the other weights in proportion, Option B
overtakes Option A only if the certification-evidence weight (CR-002) rises
above roughly 45%. The result is therefore moderately robust, but sensitive to
how heavily the program values supplier-provided certification evidence.
<<<

